          "id": "1774379009821",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774379009821_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Display the content from {{$context.$nodes.INSIGHTS_FOR_CUSTOMER_CALL.$output}} as it is. Do not change content.\n\nAfter displaying the content, generate two low priority actions named:\n- Mark Call Complete\n- Skip the Customer Call\n\nUse these exact followUpCommand values:\n- ora.Agent(recordCallNotes,<Customer Details>)\n- ora.Agent(markSkip,<Customer Details>)\n\nwhere <Customer Details> is {{$context.$nodes.RESOLVE_CUSTOMER_CONTEXT.$output.result}}.\n\nImportant:\n- Copy each followUpCommand exactly as provided\n- Do not rebuild, summarize, shorten, escape, or edit the followUpCommand\n- The command must remain a bare identifier, not a quoted string\n- If any followUpCommand contains a quoted command, regenerate the output\n\nGenerate the low priority actions in a separate line."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
