nc(sysdate) between nvl(collectionsLookups.startDateActive(+), trunc(sysdate)) and nvl(collectionsLookups.endDateActive(+), trunc(sysdate)) and collectionsLookups.lookupCode(+)=receivablesLookups.lookupCode\"}",
