            "returnType": "boolean",
            "sourceCode": "let dateFormat = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_CODE_EXTRACT_USER_PREFERENCES.$output.result.DateFormat || \"\";\n\nlet shouldInvokeMonthNameNode = /(FMMonth|MONTH|Month|MMMM|MMM|MON|Mon)/.test(dateFormat);\n\nlet result = shouldInvokeMonthNameNode;\n\nreturn result;"
