              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate one short, user-friendly message for this condition: The action can’t be completed because it is invalid or has already been processed. Please refresh and check the latest status.\n\nRules:\n- State the condition as a fact, not as a possibility.\n- Use the meaning \"invalid or already processed\".\n- Do not use words like may, might, probably, completed, backend, status code, node, or system error.\n- Do not tell the user to try again.\n- Keep it under 25 words.\n- Return only the final message text.\n\nReturn exactly the message below. Do not rewrite, shorten, paraphrase, or replace any words.\n\nThe action can’t be completed because it is invalid or has already been processed. Please refresh and check the latest status."
